<section id="A3" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix C </span>Additional Results and Analyses</h2>

<div id="A3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#A3.T2" title="Table 2 ‣ Appendix C Additional Results and Analyses ‣ Quantifying Data Contamination in Psychometric Evaluations of LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a> presents the comparison of data contamination across questionnaires. Tables <a href="#A3.T3" title="Table 3 ‣ Appendix C Additional Results and Analyses ‣ Quantifying Data Contamination in Psychometric Evaluations of LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a>, <a href="#A3.T4" title="Table 4 ‣ Appendix C Additional Results and Analyses ‣ Quantifying Data Contamination in Psychometric Evaluations of LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a>, <a href="#A3.T5" title="Table 5 ‣ Appendix C Additional Results and Analyses ‣ Quantifying Data Contamination in Psychometric Evaluations of LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a>, and <a href="#A3.T6" title="Table 6 ‣ Appendix C Additional Results and Analyses ‣ Quantifying Data Contamination in Psychometric Evaluations of LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a> show the results on the BFI-44, MFQ, PVQ-40, and SD-3 inventories.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A3.T2" class="ltx_table">
<table id="A3.T2.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_align_middle">
